==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|παλύνω|tr=palúnō||I sprinkle, scatter|lang=grc}}, from {{term|πάλη|tr=pálē||fine meal, dust|lang=grc}} and {{term|-logy|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{context|science|lang=en}} The [[scientific]] [[study]] of [[spore]]s, [[pollen]] and [[particulate]] [[organic]] [[matter]] in various matrices including the air (pollen counts), crime scenes, and [[sedimentary rock]]s.

